{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And he said.</b> This passage was fit to be written after the Tabernacle was made, but it was written in this place to tell of this miracle, that the manna endures for generations. Now Moses said thus to Israel; therefore it says, \"that I fed you.\""], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:35:11.022514884Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}